  {
    "directory": "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14098036",
    "question": {
      "math_academy_id": "q-120990",
      "knowledge_point_id": "d7ca7dee-1a1b-5af6-8719-5d2377004be9",
      "knowledge_point": "Finding the Total Displacement of a Particle Given Its Velocity",
      "problem": "A particle $P$ moves along the $x$-axis and its velocity at time $t$ is given by $v(t)=2t-\\sqrt{t}.$ What is the total displacement of the particle between $t=0$ and $t=9?$",
      "worked_solution": "We find the total displacement by calculating the definite integral of the velocity.\n\nLet $d$ be the total displacement. Then we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}d & ={\\int }_{0}^{9}(2t-\\sqrt{t})\\text{d}t \\\\  & ={({t}^{2}-\\frac{2}{3}{t}^{3/2})|}_{0}^{9} \\\\  & =[(9)^{2}-\\frac{2}{3}(9)^{3/2}]-[(0)^{2}-\\frac{2}{3}(0)^{3/2}] \\\\  & =81-18-0 \\\\  & =63.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, the total displacement between $t=0$ and $t=9$ is $63.$",
      "answer_fields": [
        {
          "key": "selection",
          "type": "radio",
          "choices_complete": true,
          "choices": [
            {
              "type": "math",
              "value": "63",
              "option": "0",
              "source_option": "a"
            },
            {
              "type": "math",
              "value": "81",
              "option": "1",
              "source_option": "b"
            },
            {
              "type": "math",
              "value": "72",
              "option": "2",
              "source_option": "c"
            },
            {
              "type": "math",
              "value": "36",
              "option": "3",
              "source_option": "d"
            },
            {
              "type": "math",
              "value": "99",
              "option": "4",
              "source_option": "e"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "source_answer_policy": {
        "version": "revealed-ma-answer-v1",
        "feedback_sha256": "42a2ca6690b76de4f198e280a303cebd92f4afcdd41fa8d0bfc07635bc7ba01e"
      },
      "difficulty": "moderate",
